~ start
set in_dialogue = true
Sean C: Whats this ... A robot?
AEON: Hello, I am AEON, a Builder robot capable of all tasks, as long as a blueprint is provided.
AEON: Do you have a blueprint?
- Yes
	if has_bp == true:
		AEON: This task will take around 127 years, Ill get to work now.
		set future = true
		set in_dialogue = false
	else:
		AEON: Come back when you have a blueprint
		set in_dialogue = false
		=> END
- No

set in_dialogue = false
=> END